    "s_7587607a6342dc0b": "Download EVA Unit-01 theme",
    "s_75c306a7bcac0b15": "From the audit log. Remember to save after adding to an allow list; adding to the deny list tells the AI explicitly that the path is off limits.",
    "s_75d889ac43a261ad": "allowed",
    "s_75dfaf262f476b6c": "Unarchiving…",
    "s_75e8c9e1324b05c4": "Permission denied",
    "s_75ebc2db53d5d555": "When a batch of tool calls starts, the user request, the current assistant text and the pending tool calls are sent in a small extra request to a sidecar model (the session model by default, or a cheaper one you pick), which returns a 3-8 word label. It works with any model and gives the most accurate titles; the cost is one small request per batch, and the daemon waits at most the configured milliseconds before saving, so a title that arrives later is shown on this page only and not written to the session record.",
