    "s_7b1c1c5b441d279b": "Check the site address and your network connection, then try again.",
    "s_7b1e53cd6386dad4": "Help generate conversation summaries, titles, and memory summaries. A local or lightweight model is recommended.",
    "s_7b48868d530b1e33": "A preamble string argument is injected into every tool schema and the system prompt asks the model to fill it on every call with an 8-12 word line (for example \"Reading registry sections\"). As soon as the argument streams in it becomes the loading text for that call, the running tool row shows it, and it is stripped before the tool executes, so the tool never sees it. No special provider capability and no extra request; about a dozen extra tokens per call. When the model occasionally leaves it out, that call falls back to the default text.",
