    "s_809f109d52267acf": "No prompt change and no extra request. When the streamed reasoning summary starts with a bold title (OpenAI Responses, Codex and Gemini summaries all do), that line becomes the title and appears on the activity row while the model is still reasoning. Without a bold title the first sentence of the reasoning is used. Models that only return raw chains of thought or prose summaries (such as DeepSeek or Claude) give weaker titles; models that return no reasoning at all produce no title and the batch falls back to the default summary.",
